 "description": "<p>A one-size campus swimsuit costume in stretch polyester, built for theme nights that value speed over fuss. The set pairs a cropped top with a matching onesie, both in high-elasticity fabric that moves with the body rather than against it.</p>\n<p>The styling reads as the classic school swimsuit look, the kind that needs no explanation at a costume party. Between the two colorways, white keeps the retro reference loudest while black reads more understated once the lights go down.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: top, onesie</li>\n<li>Features: high elasticity</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, 85-130 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The 85-130 lbs range is honest rather than optimistic: sitting at the top of it means a close, second-skin fit rather than a relaxed one.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>High-stretch campus swimsuit costume with cropped top and onesie, one size fitting 85-130 lbs in black or white.</p>\n",
